| ------------------ | --------------- | -------------- | ------------ | -------------------- |
| Amazon “Notify Me” | Product         | Users          | Stock status | Users notified       |
| YouTube            | Channel         | Subscribers    | New video    | Subscribers notified |
| Weather App        | Weather Station | Displays, Apps | Weather data | UI updates           |
| Stock Market       | Exchange        | Traders, Apps  | Price        | Price update alerts  |
